@startuml UC54_ManageLabTestCatalogue_SequenceDiagram
<style>
document {
  ParticipantPadding 10
  BoxPadding 10
}
</style>

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 250

skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor #DDEEFF
    BorderColor     #336699
    FontStyle       bold
}
skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #FFFACD
    BorderColor     #CC9900
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFF0
    BorderColor     #AAAAAA
}
skinparam ArrowColor #336699
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #336699

title UC-54: Manage Lab Test Catalogue\n(Simplified Sequence Diagram)

actor       "Clinic Manager"                             as Actor
participant "<<Controller>>\nClinicServiceController"    as CSC
participant "<<Service>>\nClinicServiceService"          as CSS
participant "<<ServiceImpl>>\nClinicServiceServiceImpl"  as CSSImpl
participant "<<Repository>>\nClinicServiceRepository"    as CSRepo
participant "<<Log>>\nAuditLog"                          as Audit

note over Actor
  PRE: Clinic Manager is authenticated.
end note

== Step 1: View Lab Test Catalogue ==
Actor -> CSC : getAllServices(type="CLINICAL")
activate CSC

CSC -> CSS : getAllServices(type="CLINICAL")
activate CSS
CSS -> CSSImpl : getAllServices(type="CLINICAL")
activate CSSImpl

CSSImpl -> CSRepo : findByServiceType("CLINICAL")
activate CSRepo
CSRepo --> CSSImpl : List<ClinicService>
deactivate CSRepo

CSSImpl --> CSS : List<ClinicServiceResponse>
deactivate CSSImpl
CSS --> CSC : List<ClinicServiceResponse>
deactivate CSS

CSC --> Actor : ResponseEntity<ApiResponse<List<ClinicServiceResponse>>>
deactivate CSC

== Step 2: Add New Lab Test ==
Actor -> CSC : createLabTest(request: LabTestRequest)
activate CSC

CSC -> CSS : createLabTest(request: LabTestRequest)
activate CSS
CSS -> CSSImpl : createLabTest(request: LabTestRequest)
activate CSSImpl

CSSImpl -> CSRepo : findByServiceName(request.serviceName)
activate CSRepo
CSRepo --> CSSImpl : Optional<ClinicService> (empty)
deactivate CSRepo

note right of CSSImpl
  BR Validation:
  - Check for duplicate serviceName.
  - Check price > 0.
  Sets serviceType = "CLINICAL".
end note

CSSImpl -> CSRepo : save(service: ClinicService)
activate CSRepo
CSRepo --> CSSImpl : ClinicService
deactivate CSRepo

CSSImpl -> Audit : logAction("CREATE_LAB_TEST", details)
activate Audit
Audit --> CSSImpl : ok
deactivate Audit

CSSImpl --> CSS : ClinicServiceResponse
deactivate CSSImpl
CSS --> CSC : ClinicServiceResponse
deactivate CSS

CSC --> Actor : HTTP 201 Created (ApiResponse<ClinicServiceResponse>)
deactivate CSC

== ALT: Invalid Price or Duplicate Name ==
note right of Actor
  If price <= 0 or name already exists,
  Service throws ValidationException.
  Controller returns HTTP 400 Bad Request.
end note

== Step 3 (Optional): Deactivate Test Type ==
Actor -> CSC : toggleActive(id: Long)
activate CSC

CSC -> CSS : toggleActive(id: Long)
activate CSS
CSS -> CSSImpl : toggleActive(id: Long)
activate CSSImpl

CSSImpl -> CSRepo : findById(id: Long)
activate CSRepo
CSRepo --> CSSImpl : ClinicService
deactivate CSRepo

note right of CSSImpl
  BR-09 (No Hard Delete):
  Toggles isActive flag (e.g., to false).
  Existing orders are unaffected.
end note

CSSImpl -> CSRepo : save(service: ClinicService)
activate CSRepo
CSRepo --> CSSImpl : ClinicService
deactivate CSRepo

CSSImpl --> CSS : ClinicServiceResponse
deactivate CSSImpl
CSS --> CSC : ClinicServiceResponse
deactivate CSS

CSC --> Actor : HTTP 200 OK (ApiResponse<ClinicServiceResponse>)
deactivate CSC

@enduml
